#: ../../source/architecture.rst:64
msgid "Fragment workflow"
msgstr "片段工作流"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:66
msgid ""
"q2m3 exports ``q2m3.run`` and ``q2m3.Molecule`` lazily. They resolve to "
"``q2m3.fragments.workflow.run`` and ``q2m3.fragments.molecule.Molecule``. The workflow accepts "
"geometry with an optional two-fragment partition. It does not call ``QuantumQMMM`` or the "
"solvation orchestrator."
msgstr ""
"q2m3 延迟导出 ``q2m3.run`` 和 ``q2m3.Molecule``。它们分别指向 ``q2m3.fragments.workflow.run`` 和 "
"``q2m3.fragments.molecule.Molecule``。工作流接收几何，可指定两个片段的划分。它不调用 ``QuantumQMMM`` 或溶剂化编排器。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:71
msgid ""
"For a dimer, counterpoise constructs ``AB``, ``A``, and ``B`` in the dimer basis. Each monomer "
"retains the other fragment's basis functions as ghost atoms. A single molecule uses subsystem "
"``M``."
msgstr "对于二聚体，counterpoise 在二聚体基组中构建 ``AB``、``A`` 和 ``B``。每个单体以虚原子形式保留另一片段的基函数。单分子使用子体系 ``M``。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:97
msgid ""
"Both modes check AVAS spaces before correlated calculations. Dimer runs also check whether "
"monomer spaces correspond to the dimer space. A mismatch raises ``ActiveSpaceMismatchError``."
msgstr "两种模式均在关联计算前检查 AVAS 空间。二聚体计算还检查单体空间与二聚体空间的对应关系。不匹配时抛出 ``ActiveSpaceMismatchError``。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:101
msgid ""
"``classical_only`` computes HF and frozen-core MP2 without constructing an SQD runner. ``full`` "
"requires the SQD extra. It adds:"
msgstr "``classical_only`` 计算 HF 和冻结芯 MP2，不构建 SQD 执行器。``full`` 需要 SQD extra。它增加以下计算："

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:104
msgid "A frozen-core CCSD(T) reference when its predicted cost fits ``CCSDTBudget``."
msgstr "预测成本符合 ``CCSDTBudget`` 时，计算冻结芯 CCSD(T) 参考。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:105
msgid "Active-space integrals and an ``IntegralContext`` for each subsystem."
msgstr "为各子体系构建活性空间积分和 ``IntegralContext``。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:106
msgid "A CCSD seed and SQD calculation for each subsystem."
msgstr "为各子体系构建 CCSD 种子并执行 SQD。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:107
msgid "QPE cost estimates and SQD workload and memory estimates from those integrals."
msgstr "从这些积分估算 QPE 成本、SQD 工作量和内存。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:109
msgid ""
"A budget-rejected CCSD(T) reference remains absent with a reason. The QPE estimate uses double "
"factorization. It does not execute a ``QPEEngine`` circuit."
msgstr "预算拒绝 CCSD(T) 时，参考值保持缺失并附带原因。QPE 估算使用双因子分解，不执行 ``QPEEngine`` 电路。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:113
msgid "Execution and result boundaries"
msgstr "执行与结果边界"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:115
msgid ""
"``SubprocessSQDRunner`` starts one child interpreter for all subsystem jobs. The child runs jobs "
"serially. Its OpenMP, MKL, OpenBLAS, and Rayon thread counts are one. The parent retains its "
"thread settings."
msgstr ""
"``SubprocessSQDRunner`` 为所有子体系任务启动一个子解释器。子解释器串行执行任务。其 OpenMP、MKL、OpenBLAS 和 Rayon "
"线程数均为一。父进程保留原线程设置。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:119
msgid ""
"The child builds each CCSD seed before calling ``run_sqd_from_integrals``. SQD applies its own "
"supervisor, resource caps, and reference policy. The first job failure stops later jobs. The "
"parent propagates the failure and cleans up stage processes."
msgstr ""
"子解释器在调用 ``run_sqd_from_integrals`` 前构建各 CCSD 种子。SQD "
"使用自身的监督执行器、资源上限和参考策略。首个任务失败后不再执行后续任务。父进程传递失败并清理本阶段进程。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:123
msgid ""
"For each energy layer, the dimer result computes ``E(AB) - E(A) - E(B)`` in Hartree. A missing "
"subsystem energy makes that interaction energy absent. Only a T0 ``exact_casci`` baseline "
"supplies ``e_casci``. The result retains each complete ``SQDResult``, provenance, warnings, and "
"absence reasons."
msgstr ""
"各能量层均以 Hartree 计算 ``E(AB) - E(A) - E(B)``。任一子体系能量缺失时，该相互作用能也缺失。只有 T0 ``exact_casci`` 基准可提供 "
"``e_casci``。结果保留各完整 ``SQDResult``、来源记录、警告和缺失原因。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:128
msgid ""
"Error decomposition separates algorithm, active-space, basis, and model differences. The same-"
"basis reference uses computed CCSD(T), or an imported reference when CCSD(T) is absent. Missing "
"inputs leave the corresponding error absent. ``render_report`` derives a Markdown report from the"
" results. Imported experimental Ks values appear beside the results without statistical "
"conclusions."
msgstr ""
"误差分解区分算法、活性空间、基组和模型差异。同基组参考优先使用计算得到的 CCSD(T)。CCSD(T) 缺失时使用导入参考。输入缺失时，相应误差保持缺失。``render_report`` "
"从结果生成 Markdown 报告。导入的实验 Ks 值与结果并列展示，不附带统计结论。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:135
msgid "Optional fragment tools"
msgstr "可选片段工具"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:137
msgid "These tools require explicit calls. ``run`` does not invoke them:"
msgstr "以下工具需要显式调用。``run`` 不调用它们："

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:139
msgid ""
"``structure`` reads experimental dimers, normalizes X-H bonds, and supports DFT-D3(BJ) geometry "
"optimization."
msgstr "``structure`` 读取实验二聚体、规范 X-H 键长，并支持 DFT-D3(BJ) 几何优化。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:140
msgid "``external.psi4`` runs an external Psi4 interpreter for an HF counterpoise comparison."
msgstr "``external.psi4`` 使用外部 Psi4 解释器执行 HF counterpoise 对照。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:141
msgid "``diagnostics.entropy`` computes DMRG orbital entropies and mutual information."
msgstr "``diagnostics.entropy`` 计算 DMRG 轨道熵和互信息。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:143
msgid ""
"``importers`` reads CSV or QCSchema reference energies. ``run(references=...)`` invokes this "
"importer when callers supply reference paths."
msgstr "``importers`` 读取 CSV 或 QCSchema 参考能量。调用者传入参考文件路径时，``run(references=...)`` 调用该导入器。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:146
msgid ""
"These workflows do not implement polarizable MM or an SQD-MC loop. Fragment interaction energies "
"are not solvation free energies."
msgstr "这些工作流不实现可极化 MM 或 SQD-MC 循环。片段相互作用能不是溶剂化自由能。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:150
msgid "QPE and solvation"
msgstr "QPE 与溶剂化"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:152
msgid ""
"``QuantumQMMM.compute_ground_state`` constructs a Hamiltonian through the PySCF/PennyLane "
"converter. It calls ``QPEEngine`` for energy estimation and can request RDM measurements. A "
"classical fallback exercises the QM/MM pipeline when no PennyLane Hamiltonian is available."
msgstr ""
"``QuantumQMMM.compute_ground_state`` 通过 PySCF/PennyLane 转换器构建哈密顿量。它调用 ``QPEEngine`` 估算能量，也可请求 RDM"
" 测量。没有 PennyLane 哈密顿量时，经典回退路径用于检查 QM/MM 数据流程。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:156
msgid ""
"Solvation uses a separate orchestrator with ``fixed``, ``hf_corrected``, and ``dynamic`` modes. "
"Catalyst compiles circuit structure for repeated execution. The IR cache keys include molecule, "
"basis, active space, estimation wires, Trotter depth, circuit style, and embedding mode. Dynamic "
"updates change diagonal coefficients. Full-one-electron embedding requires a fixed Hamiltonian "
"because off-diagonal terms can change operator support. See :doc:`user-guide/core-concepts` for "
"the energy models and physical limits."
msgstr ""
"溶剂化使用独立编排器，支持 ``fixed``、``hf_corrected`` 和 ``dynamic`` 模式。Catalyst 编译电路结构以供重复执行。IR "
"缓存键包含分子、基组、活性空间、估算线数、Trotter 深度、电路类型和嵌入模式。动态更新只改变对角系数。非对角项可能改变算符集合，因此完整单电子嵌入要求固定哈密顿量。能量模型和物理限制见 "
":doc:`user-guide/core-concepts`。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:163
msgid ""
"``device_type=\"auto\"`` selects an available PennyLane device. Catalyst execution depends "
"separately on the JAX/Catalyst backend. A Lightning GPU device name alone does not establish GPU "
"execution for a compiled circuit."
msgstr ""
"``device_type=\"auto\"`` 选择可用的 PennyLane 设备。Catalyst 执行另由 JAX/Catalyst 后端决定。仅有 Lightning GPU "
"设备名称，不能证明编译电路在 GPU 上执行。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:168
msgid "SQD entry points"
msgstr "SQD 入口"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:170
msgid ""
"The geometry entry constructs a vacuum RHF frame, active-space integrals, and a CCSD seed. The "
"integral entry accepts those data with an authenticated ``IntegralContext`` and ``CCSDSeed``. "
"Fragments uses the integral entry with its AVAS-selected subsystem Hamiltonians. Both entries "
"share the SQD executor."
msgstr ""
"几何入口构建真空 RHF 框架、活性空间积分和 CCSD 种子。积分入口接收这些数据及经过认证的 ``IntegralContext`` 和 ``CCSDSeed``。片段工作流将 AVAS "
"选择的子体系哈密顿量交给积分入口。两个入口共享 SQD 执行器。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:175
msgid ""
"The executor checks frame and Hamiltonian hashes, tensor shapes, symmetries, constants, energies,"
" and residuals. It applies a shared wall deadline and polls process-tree RSS. Preprocessing "
"performed before ``run_sqd_from_integrals`` is outside that call's resource measurement. See :doc"
":`user-guide/sqd` for platform and calibration limits."
msgstr ""
"执行器检查框架和哈密顿量哈希、张量形状、对称性、常数、能量和残差。它使用共享墙钟截止时间，轮询进程树 RSS。调用 ``run_sqd_from_integrals`` "
"前的预处理不在该调用的资源测量范围内。平台与校准限制见 :doc:`user-guide/sqd`。"

